flowchart LR
    A[Battery Dataset] --> B[Data Preprocessing]
    B --> C[Feature Selection]
    C --> D[Feature Scaling]
    D --> E[Chronological Sequence Generation]

    E --> F[Train Set]
    E --> G[Validation Set]
    E --> H[Test Set]

    F --> I[PI-GLSTM Model]

    I --> I1[LSTM Temporal Encoder]
    I1 --> I2[SoH Degradation Head]
    I1 --> I3[RUL Prediction Head]

    I2 --> I4[Softplus]
    I4 --> I5[Non-negative Degradation Increment]
    I5 --> I6[Cumulative Degradation]
    I6 --> I7[SoH Trajectory]

    I3 --> J[RUL Prediction]

    I7 --> K[Composite Loss]
    J --> K

    G --> L[Validation Loss]
    L --> M[Early Stopping / Best Model Restoration]

    K --> N[Backpropagation]
    N --> I

    M --> O[Trained PI-GLSTM]